            <ArticleTitle>The cracked tooth syndrome: an elusive diagnosis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1502-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors review the literature and present a case of cracked tooth syndrome. Special emphasis is placed on diagnostic problems associated with this syndrome. The case report demonstrates classic and atypical features of cracked tooth syndrome.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
